# --- Referee-revision deliverables -------------------------------------------
# The rules above exclude *.pdf / *.npz / *.out repo-wide. The revision has to
# ship the actual artifacts (figures, split manifests, run logs), not only the
# scripts that would regenerate them, so the delivery directories are re-included.
!new_figure/**/*.pdf
!new_figure/**/*.npz
!new_figure/**/*.out
!results/fixed_config_runs/**/*.out
# The seeded split manifest that test_split_comparison.json points to. Without it
# the "both cells used the same test indices" claim in reply4 item 5 cannot be
# checked by anyone else. Model weights (*.pth) stay excluded deliberately.
!results/fixed_config_runs/**/*.npz

# Superseded runs kept only as a local record. Never shipped: the re-inclusions
# above are scoped to new_figure/, so a withdrawn figure must live outside it or
# `git add new_figure/` would sweep it back in.
deprecated/
